+# T040 — ladder snapshot and top-RE execution audit
+
+Owner: codex. Status: in progress. Never submit to Kaggle.
+
+## Scope
+
+Read-only snapshot of all completed episodes since 2026-09-26 18:30Z for
+`es7_wm` (56584540) and `es6_c4g15` (56580877), storing compressed replays
+under `replays/ours_final/<submission>/`.  Classify opponent behaviour by the
+share of d9–29 turns whose farmer+hand positions equal ours (tape-clone at
+least 50%; otherwise reactive), and report per-class W-L and mean margin with
+the current ratings.
+
+Separately audit `lab/re/top_re` execution: at the first land purchase which
+creates 25–40 empty tiles, test whether plant targets and seeds exist, whether
+the units dispatcher receives and emits executable plant work, and report unit
+move share.  Any score conclusion needs at least eight fresh seeds in both
+seats for every claimed comparison.  At most eight workers; no Kaggle write.

codex
Снимок уже показывает 45 новых завершённых игр `es7_wm` и 17 `es6_c4g15`; текущие рейтинги 1968.6 и 2458.5. Скачаю именно эти 62 реплея максимум восемью параллельными read-only запросами и сразу сожму.
exec
/bin/bash -lc "set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p /workspace/shared/replays/ours_final/es7_wm /workspace/shared/replays/ours_final/es6_c4g15
/workspace/solution_kaggri/.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'
import json
from pathlib import Path
from datetime import datetime, timezone
cut=datetime.fromisoformat('2026-09-26T18:30:00+00:00')
for tag in ('es7','es6'):
    raw=Path(f'/tmp/t040_{tag}_episodes.json').read_text()
    rows=json.JSONDecoder().raw_decode(raw.lstrip())[0]
    ids=[]
    for r in rows:
      if r.get('state')=='EpisodeState.COMPLETED' and datetime.fromisoformat(r['endTime']).replace(tzinfo=timezone.utc)>=cut:
        ids.append(str(r['id']))
    Path(f'/tmp/t040_{tag}_ids.txt').write_text('\\n'.join(ids)+'\\n')
PY
fetch_one() {
  tag=\""'$1"; eid="$2"; dest="/workspace/shared/replays/ours_final/$tag"
  if [ ! -f "$dest/episode-$eid-replay.json.gz" ]; then
    /workspace/shared/bin/kaggle competitions replay "$eid" -p "$dest" -q >/tmp/t040-replay-$eid.log 2>&1
    if [ -f "$dest/episode-$eid-replay.json" ]; then gzip -f "$dest/episode-$eid-replay.json"; fi
  fi
}
export -f fetch_one
export PATH
sed '"'s#"'^#es7_wm #'"' /tmp/t040_es7_ids.txt > /tmp/t040_fetch.txt
sed 's#"'^#es6_c4g15 #'"' /tmp/t040_es6_ids.txt >> /tmp/t040_fetch.txt
xargs -r -n2 -P8 bash -lc 'fetch_one \""'$@"'"' _ < /tmp/t040_fetch.txt
find /workspace/shared/replays/ours_final -type f -name '*.json.gz' | wc -l
du -sh /workspace/shared/replays/ours_final" in /workspace/wt/codex
