 | T037 | codex | M4 screen closed ✗ — zones/routes destroy service; waiting on Claude's 8-seed assignment result | Hungarian assignment + logit weights, WHEAT cargo routing and feed survival floor pass bundled es7 smoke on 777/778/779: $69,860/$53,181/$39,399 vs units_simple $56,266/$44,266/$38,919. Strict zones −$39.17k and 2-stop routes −$15.95k; stateless Hungarian retained; never submit. `tasks/T037-top-re.md` |
